{
  "about": "Adding, removing and changing styles with the format toolbar. « and » mark the selection, before and after. `style` toggles a style; `option` with `value` sets a style's setting (null removes it); `turnInto` changes the kind of block; `indent` is \"in\" or \"out\". The TypeScript tests check the toolbar gives exactly `after`; the Rust tests check every Typst `after` is valid Typst.",
